This repository redistributes, unmodified, the model weights of the Laya decision
models published by Convai Innovations on the Hugging Face Hub at
https://huggingface.co/convaiinnovations/laya (revision
55cf4c4ebb4ebe31b2550e8bdf3bd21b99753851), licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. The Laya software (https://github.com/NandhaKishorM/laya,
https://pypi.org/project/laya/) is also Apache-2.0 and is installed from PyPI;
it is not redistributed here. The upstream model card (README.md) is included
inside the english tarball.

The english and typed-decisions checkpoints build on ModernBERT-large
(answerdotai/ModernBERT-large, Apache-2.0); the multilingual checkpoint builds on
mmBERT-base (jhu-clsp/mmBERT-base, MIT). See the upstream model card for details.
